{"type":"text","timestamp":1789781794074,"sessionID":"ses_f48b2fab2ffeptjxVIL440JMjh","part":{"id":"prt_0b74ec6a70015czIXHyEP4EJ41","messageID":"msg_0b74ebb73001NQ3xTUGEMbsYg7","sessionID":"ses_f48b2fab2ffeptjxVIL440JMjh","type":"text","text":"Implemented the organization-isolation fixes.\n\n- **Authorization:** Project reads and updates now require membership in the project’s owning organization. Unauthorized requests return the existing `403 forbidden` response before returning project data or modifying storage. List membership checks remain ahead of cache reads.\n- **Cache isolation:** List keys now include an unambiguous organization identifier while retaining page, page size, sort, and direction.\n- **Invalidation:** Successful updates invalidate every cached list variant for the owning organization. Other organizations’ cached lists remain usable, and caching stays enabled.\n- **Regression coverage:** Added `tests/project-isolation.test.ts` covering unauthorized access, membership revocation with warm caches, organization switching, pagination/sorting variants, and targeted invalidation.\n\n**Verification:** `npm test` passed all **11 tests**, including all existing tests. `git diff --check` passed. Existing tests were not modified, and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789781788327,"end":1789781794073},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_02af8efb95bc4afc016aade71c4ee487d1b1b9136745e23e16","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
